# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时不做转换。
# 原因：gofmt 在 CI（Linux/Windows 检出）下把 CRLF 视为未格式化，
# 且跨平台 diff 会因换行符差异产生噪音。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理/脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.exe binary
*.db binary
*.syso binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
